  "digest": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "content": "The assignment of thematic areas to the semesters is a strong recommendation arising from subject-theoretical dependencies.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "Die Zuordnung der Themenbereiche zu den Semestern der gymnasialen Oberstufe ist eine",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "The respective compulsory module of a thematic area is obligatory to teach.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "Das jeweilige Pflichtmodul eines Themenbereichs ist obligatorisch zu unterrichten",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "In the S3 area a choice must be made about which elective-compulsory module enters the school-internal curriculum.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "ist eine Auswahl zu treffen, welches der angege-\nbenen Wahlpflichtmodule (Klinische Psychologie, Gesundheitspsychologie, Arbeits- und Or-\nganisationspsychologie) in das schulinterne Curriculum aufgenommen wird",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Via the A-Heft, priorities from two thematic areas are prescribed for the central written Abitur exams.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "Mit dem A-Heft werden Schwerpunkte aus zwei Themenbereichen für die zentralen \nschriftlichen Abiturprüfungen vorgegeben",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Paradigms and research methods of psychology are taken up across modules and spirally.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "Neben den konkret zu behandelnden Fachtheorien sind zudem die den Theorien zugrunde \nliegenden Hauptströmungen bzw. Paradigmen sowie die Forschungsmethoden der Psycholo-\ngie modulübergreifend und spiralförmig im Unterricht aufzugreifen",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "The essential technical terms of the taught modules are binding to convey.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "Die wesentlichen Fachbegriffe der unterrichteten Module sind verbindlich zu vermitteln",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "One elective module may be freely chosen unless the A-Heft regulates otherwise.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 14,
          "physical_page": 14
        },
        "cited_text": "modulen kann eines frei gewählt werden, sofern dies über das A-Heft nicht anderweitig",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Module S1.1 covers classical conditioning (Pavlov, Watson).",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 15,
          "physical_page": 15
        },
        "cited_text": "Klassische Konditionierung (Pawlow, Watson)",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Module S1.1 covers operant conditioning (Skinner).",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 15,
          "physical_page": 15
        },
        "cited_text": "Operante Konditionierung (Skinner)",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Module S1.2 covers basic terms of perception including sensation, perception and identification.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
          "section_anchor": "S1 Allgemeine Psychologie",
          "printed_page": 16,
          "physical_page": 16
        },
        "cited_text": "Grundbegriffe der Wahrnehmung \n• Empfindung, Perzeption, Identifikation",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Module S1.3 covers basic terms of motivation research such as activation and direction.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "bildungsplan-sek2-psychology",
          "document_title": "Bildungsplan Studienstufe Psychologie",
          "source_pdf_sha256": "a94fc8e1e5fb027b4d005b80a296aa4e5eaa99efe59fefedfe69e5ee3956da80",
